Current-head GitHub CI is **not all green**: 49 checks passed and 44 were skipped; [`checks-ui-e2e (7/9)`](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/39880171327/job/120175825980) failed on `keeps the light mobile Panels sheet bounded and its actions reachable`, with a 30-second timeout looking for the desktop Panels button in `openChatPanels`. The CI gate consequently fails. The failing test and helper are byte-identical between the CI merge and its main parent `bd21bb527237e6f63ea8967bb745237df4094342`; this establishes source provenance, not that the failure is unrelated. Its attribution remains unconfirmed. The three UI test shards, eight other UI E2E shards, type checks and the focused feature proof passed.

